<!--
  "Back to the track": the button that reframes the map on the data after the
  user has panned or zoomed away. Material Symbols "crop_free" — a frame with
  its sides cut out, which reads as "fit this into the view" without implying
  a location or a refresh. Inlined as a vector for the same reason as the
  content icons: two or three icons do not justify the ~2 MB that
  material-icons-extended adds before shrinking. Filled black on purpose;
  Compose recolours it via Icon(tint = ...).
-->
